      "spice_path": "schematic->netlist->ngspice->waveform",
      "notes": "Direct SPICE netlist path; no IR lowering used for this demo. The visual schematic includes the PULSE gate source and 4-terminal voltage-controlled switch used by Ssw vin sw gate 0."
